# Comandos utilizados — Diagnóstico do processo Firefox

Comandos executados na ordem do experimento, no ambiente Ubuntu (VM VirtualBox, usuário `vboxuser`).

## 1. Identificar o processo

```bash
pgrep -a firefox
```
```
24287 /snap/firefox/6966/usr/lib/firefox/firefox
```

## 2. PID / PPID / estado / recursos

```bash
ps -o pid,ppid,stat,pri,ni,%cpu,%mem,cmd -p 24287
```
```
  PID    PPID STAT PRI  NI %CPU %MEM CMD
24287       1 Sl    19   0  0.3 16.9 /snap/firefox/6966/usr/lib/firefox/firefox
```

## 3. Árvore de processos

```bash
pstree -p 24287
```
(saída completa em `evidencias/02-arvore-processos/`)

## 4. Threads

```bash
ps -L -p 24287
```
(saída completa em `evidencias/04-threads/`)

## 5. Informações em /proc/PID

```bash
cat /proc/24287/status
cat /proc/24287/stat
cat /proc/24287/limits
# [PREENCHER] 4ª fonte, ex:
cat /proc/24287/cmdline | tr '\0' ' '
```

## 6. Sinal SIGSTOP

```bash
kill -STOP 24287
ps -o pid,ppid,stat,pri,ni,%cpu,%mem,cmd -p 24287
```
```
  PID    PPID STAT PRI  NI %CPU %MEM CMD
24287       1 Tl    19   0  0.3 15.4 /snap/firefox/6966/usr/lib/firefox/firefox
```

## 7. Sinal SIGCONT

```bash
kill -CONT 24287
ps -o pid,ppid,stat,pri,ni,%cpu,%mem,cmd -p 24287
```
```
  PID    PPID STAT PRI  NI %CPU %MEM CMD
24287       1 Sl    19   0  0.3 15.4 /snap/firefox/6966/usr/lib/firefox/firefox
```

## 8. Alterar prioridade (nice/renice)

```bash
renice 5 -p 24287
```
```
24287 (process ID) old priority 0, new priority 5
```
```bash
ps -o pid,ppid,stat,pri,ni,%cpu,%mem,cmd -p 24287
```
```
  PID    PPID STAT PRI  NI %CPU %MEM CMD
24287       1 SNl   14   5  0.3 15.4 /snap/firefox/6966/usr/lib/firefox/firefox
```

## 9. Sinal SIGTERM

```bash
kill -TERM 24287
ps -p 24287
```
```
 PID TTY          TIME CMD
(sem saída — processo encerrado)
```
